the new war is the latest and largest  cinematic story-based expansion for one  of the best free-to-play games out there  warframe and it's available today for  free on all platforms the new war  features a conflict that has been  brewing between the sentience and the  tenno for years and you'll be able to  fight in it using three new playable  characters old enemies come back new  enemies emerge and a new warframe will  join the ranks as well the game has been  updated with countless quality  improvements to make it more fun and  accessible this is the perfect moment to  get into warframe for the first time and  for previous children of the lotus to  come home to the game warframe is almost  9 years old but it's still in the top 15  games on steam warframe has a community  of more than 70 million registered  players worldwide and that's because the  developer digital extremes has spent  that time developing an epic personal  storyline and adding new content that  brings the space warriors out of the  confined spaceships and into large open  worlds it's been optimized for  solid-state drives and next-gen consoles  looks beautiful in 4k at 60fps and they  never stopped adding to the huge arsenal  of warframes weapons and mods which lets  you customize your play experience to  exactly what you want the warframe story  evolves with each update in an ever  expanding world of lore and rich  storytelling the critically acclaimed  campaign is now more than 30 hours long  and spans 13 cinematic quests the new  war expansion is the culmination of  years of in-game conflict and mystery  and its story will serve as the  foundation for the next chapter of  warframe it focuses on the interpersonal  relationship between the tenno and the  lotus who has been their mother figure  and it has some amazing gameplay  innovations that i won't spoil for you  here speaking of lore here's a quick  refresher a highly advanced race called  the oregon were running out of resources  in their solar system when they  discovered the void a plane of existence  with massive power that allowed for  travel to other distant solar systems  they sent the colony ship zaraman 10-0  through the void to establish a foothold  in a new system exposure to the void  though turned the adults on that ship  into murderous lunatics but it gave the  children strange powers these children  became known as the tenno after the ship  that carried them the oregon still low  on resources in their solar system  created a race of self-repairing robots  to brave the void they successfully made  it through and after a time in the new  system they actually developed sentience  rallied by their new leader hun how they  rebelled against the oregon who called  the robots they created the sentience it  was discovered by an oregon researcher  named margalist that the tenno's powers  allowed them to bond with the  biomechanical armor units called  warframes and they became the best and  only weapon the oricon had to combat the  sentience the war against the sentience  was one but the oregon now feared the  tenno and executed margolis for defying  their orders to destroy the warframes  the sentient leader hunhau also feared  the tenno and he sent his daughter nata  to destroy them but upon seeing that  they were children nataa betrayed her  father and became the lotus a mother and  protector to all tenno the oregon empire  fell to ruin with many warring factions  taking the place of the united whole  this conflict was known as the old war  in the new war the sentients have  returned and are launching a massive  invasion to conquer the origin system at  their head is hunhau's son era who paves  a path of destruction that pushes you to  explore new edges of the origin system  in an attempt to fight back the invading  force all the factions in the origin  system have to unite or suffer the same  fate as the oricon the new war brings  old enemies together to fight the  biggest threat in the galaxy don't be  afraid  the new war is promised to be the  biggest story-driven cinematic quest in  warframe history with massive missions  and hours of action-packed gameplay and  storytelling but there's a lot more  content coming in the new war than just  story for the first time you take on the  role of faction members you have up to  now largely only fought against which  adds exciting new ways to play you use  the heavy grineer military weapons as  clone soldier designated call 175 as the  corpus technician vessel you prefer to  take an indirect approach relying on  gadgets and drones rather than direct  conflict and when you play as the dax  elite guard named teshin you ninja  sprint directly into the sentient horde  sword slashing all of them fighting in a  war against the sentience and we get to  experience the war through their  individual character stories told from  their perspective  the destruction reaped on the origin  system by the sentient invasion will  change the world of warframe as we know  it in the tennocon trailer we saw what  they did to the town of cetus and that  was only the first attack so you can  expect to see a lot more destruction in  their path the sentients seem to have  taken over the design department at  digital extremes as well because the new  war update releases skins that reimagine  mesa and volt as if the sentients had  designed them and it unveils the first  of its kind protovir armor set which  actually evolves as you kill sentient  enemies until it unlocks its ultimate  form the new war introduces the 48th  warframe to join the ranks caliban is a  half sentient hybrid created by era who  does massive aoe damage with his scythe  made from a whim of a fallen idol on in  addition hero prime the enhanced and  elegant variant of warframe's fan  favorite dark priest will be released  with the new war alongside his signature  weapons and accessories the new war  promises to be the biggest and most  ambitious update in warframe history  with its epic new cinematic quest  playable new characters and warframes  and so much more one thing is for sure  whether you're brand new to the origin  system or returning to fight the  sentience there's never been a better  time to play warframe the new war is  available now on all platforms embark on  an all-out war against the sentience and  discover your power within by signing up  and playing for free today at  warframe.com
 

